# EU Cookie Consent Suite

## Bump version on every release

When shipping fixes or features, increment the plugin version in **all** of these:

1. `eu-cookie-consent-suite/eu-cookie-consent-suite.php` — `Version:` header
2. `eu-cookie-consent-suite/includes/Plugin.php` — `WPEU_CS_VERSION` constant
3. `eu-cookie-consent-suite/readme.txt` — `Stable tag:` and a new `= x.y.z =` changelog entry

Use semver (e.g. `1.0.0` → `1.0.1` for bugfixes). Rebuild zip after bump:

```bash
bash scripts/build-release.sh
```

Deploy only `build/eu-cookie-consent-suite.zip` (not legacy `wp-eu-cookie-suite.zip`).

## PHP file order (namespaced classes)

`namespace` must immediately follow `declare(strict_types=1);`. ABSPATH guard goes **after** namespace:

```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);

namespace WPEU\CookieSuite\Example;

if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) {
	exit;
}
```

Putting `ABSPATH` before `namespace` causes a fatal error on activation.
